    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You may spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to empower a melee weapon. Empowering the weapon takes a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>. From that point forward, the Empowered Weapon deals an additional die of damage, but only when wielded by you.<br><br>For example, an empowered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> deals 3d8 points of damage, instead of 2d8 points of damage. Others who wield the weapon do not gain the bonus damage die.",
